{"id":"316f1b7b5c453f9e","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-pac-learning.md","title":"Probably Approximately Correct Learning","display":"df-pac-learning — Probably Approximately Correct Learning","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-pac-learning","aliases":["28-df-pac-learning","PAC Learning"],"display":"df-pac-learning — Probably Approximately Correct Learning","depends_on":["[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, p.59 footnote 7 (Occam/Valiant learning background); local PAC definition","source_printed_pages":"59","source_reference_before_R6":"p.66 Occam/Valiant learning note; local PAC definition","source_pages_before_R6":"printed 66 / PDF 92","source_pdf_pages":"85","source_statement_verified":false,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-pac-learning"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-pac-learning</span><span>PAC Learning</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pac-learning — Probably Approximately Correct Learning"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, p.59 footnote 7 (Occam/Valiant learning background); local PAC definition"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"59"},{"key":"source_reference_before_R6","html":"p.66 Occam/Valiant learning note; local PAC definition"},{"key":"source_pages_before_R6","html":"printed 66 / PDF 92"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"85"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；概念与假设表示结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=((C_n,c_n))_n,\\mathcal H=((H_n,h_n))_n\">\\(\\mathcal C=((C_n,c_n))_n,\\mathcal H=((H_n,h_n))_n\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_n,H_n\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(C_n,H_n\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>结构分量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_n(z)=c_{n,z}\">\\(c_n(z)=c_{n,z}\\)</span>；每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in C_n\">\\(z\\in C_n\\)</span> 有解码函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_{n,z}:\\Sigma^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(c_{n,z}:\\Sigma^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；结构分量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_n(w)=h_{n,w}\">\\(h_n(w)=h_{n,w}\\)</span>；每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in H_n\">\\(w\\in H_n\\)</span> 有解码函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_{n,w}:\\Sigma^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(h_{n,w}:\\Sigma^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,s\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n,s\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\">\\(u,v\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h,c:\\Sigma^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(h,c:\\Sigma^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^n\">\\(\\Sigma^n\\)</span> 上所有概率分布；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_j\">\\(U_j\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^j\">\\(\\Sigma^j\\)</span> 上均匀随机串（每个串概率 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{-j}\">\\(2^{-j}\\)</span>），与训练样本独立；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 是目标代码长度上界；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 读取资源的一元字符串、下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{sample},n}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{sample},n}\\)</span> 编码的样本序列及随机串，输出假设代码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tup}_6\">\\(\\operatorname{tup}_6\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in(\\Sigma^n\\times\\{0,1\\})^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(S\\in(\\Sigma^n\\times\\{0,1\\})^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\Sigma^n\">\\(x\\in\\Sigma^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{sample},n}(())\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{sample},n}(\\langle(x,b)\\rangle^\\frown S)\\coloneqq x\\langle b\\rangle\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{sample},n}(S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{sample},n}(())\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{sample},n}(\\langle(x,b)\\rangle^\\frown S)\\coloneqq x\\langle b\\rangle\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{sample},n}(S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{err}_D(h,c)\\coloneqq\\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n}D(x)\\mathbf1[h(x)\\ne c(x)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{err}_D(h,c)\\coloneqq\\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n}D(x)\\mathbf1[h(x)\\ne c(x)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pr[(D,c)^m=((x_i,c(x_i)))_{i=1}^m]\\coloneqq\\prod_{i=1}^m D(x_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pr[(D,c)^m=((x_i,c(x_i)))_{i=1}^m]\\coloneqq\\prod_{i=1}^m D(x_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PACLearn}(A,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal H)\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\land\\exists p,t\\in\\mathbb N[n,s,u,v]\\ \\forall n,s\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall u,v\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\ \\forall z\\in C_n\\ \\forall D\\in\\{d:\\Sigma^n\\to[0,1]:\\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n}d(x)=1\\}\\ \\bigl[|z|\\le s\\Rightarrow\\;&amp;\\Pr_{S\\leftarrow(D,c_{n,z})^{p(n,s,u,v)},\\ r\\leftarrow U_{t(n,s,u,v)}}[\\\\\n&amp;\\exists w\\in H_n\\ [A(\\operatorname{tup}_6(1^n,1^s,1^u,1^v,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{sample},n}(S),r))=w\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{err}_D(h_{n,w},c_{n,z})\\le1/u]]\\ge1-1/v\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PACLearn}(A,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal H)\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\land\\exists p,t\\in\\mathbb N[n,s,u,v]\\ \\forall n,s\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall u,v\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\ \\forall z\\in C_n\\ \\forall D\\in\\{d:\\Sigma^n\\to[0,1]:\\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n}d(x)=1\\}\\ \\bigl[|z|\\le s\\Rightarrow\\;&amp;\\Pr_{S\\leftarrow(D,c_{n,z})^{p(n,s,u,v)},\\ r\\leftarrow U_{t(n,s,u,v)}}[\\\\\n&amp;\\exists w\\in H_n\\ [A(\\operatorname{tup}_6(1^n,1^s,1^u,1^v,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{sample},n}(S),r))=w\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{err}_D(h_{n,w},c_{n,z})\\le1/u]]\\ge1-1/v\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>这是采用二进制概念表示的高效、分布无关、可实现 PAC 定义；s、n、精度与置信度均进入资源界，样本与学习者随机带独立。倒数整数精度与任意实精度等价，只需向上取整。保证输出落在假设代码类，而非任意对象。原书没有定位到此完整定义，因此本条是本地扩展，不能宣称直接源于书中定理。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：p.59 footnote 7 (Occam/Valiant learning background); local PAC definition，印刷页 59；PDF 页 85。原书未定位到本条的完整直接陈述；这是与书中主题相关的本地补充。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,s\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$u,v\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}$，$m\\in\\mathbb N$；$h,c:\\Sigma^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$。$D$ 遍历 $\\Sigma^n$ 上所有概率分布；$U_j$ 为 $\\Sigma^j$ 上均匀随机串（每个串概率 $2^{-j}$），与训练样本独立；$s$ 是目标代码长度上界；$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A$ 读取资源的一元字符串、下式 $\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{sample},n}$ 编码的样本序列及随机串，输出假设代码；$\\operatorname{tup}_6$ 采用 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]。$S\\in(\\Sigma^n\\times\\{0,1\\})^{<\\omega}$，$x\\in\\Sigma^n$，$b\\in\\{0,1\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C=((C_n,c_n))_n,\\mathcal H=((H_n,h_n))_n","display":false},{"tex":"C_n,H_n\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"c_n(z)=c_{n,z}","display":false},{"tex":"z\\in C_n","display":false},{"tex":"c_{n,z}:\\Sigma^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"h_n(w)=h_{n,w}","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in H_n","display":false},{"tex":"h_{n,w}:\\Sigma^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n,s\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"u,v\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"h,c:\\Sigma^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^n","display":false},{"tex":"U_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^j","display":false},{"tex":"2^{-j}","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{sample},n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tup}_6","display":false},{"tex":"S\\in(\\Sigma^n\\times\\{0,1\\})^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\Sigma^n","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{sample},n}(())\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{sample},n}(\\langle(x,b)\\rangle^\\frown S)\\coloneqq x\\langle b\\rangle\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{sample},n}(S).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{err}_D(h,c)\\coloneqq\\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n}D(x)\\mathbf1[h(x)\\ne c(x)].","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pr[(D,c)^m=((x_i,c(x_i)))_{i=1}^m]\\coloneqq\\prod_{i=1}^m D(x_i).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PACLearn}(A,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal H)\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\land\\exists p,t\\in\\mathbb N[n,s,u,v]\\ \\forall n,s\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall u,v\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\ \\forall z\\in C_n\\ \\forall D\\in\\{d:\\Sigma^n\\to[0,1]:\\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n}d(x)=1\\}\\ \\bigl[|z|\\le s\\Rightarrow\\;&\\Pr_{S\\leftarrow(D,c_{n,z})^{p(n,s,u,v)},\\ r\\leftarrow U_{t(n,s,u,v)}}[\\\\\n&\\exists w\\in H_n\\ [A(\\operatorname{tup}_6(1^n,1^s,1^u,1^v,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{sample},n}(S),r))=w\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{err}_D(h_{n,w},c_{n,z})\\le1/u]]\\ge1-1/v\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":